{"id":"alerte","lemma":"alerte","pos":"adj","rank":1409,"glosses":["alert","agile"],"ipa":"/a.lɛʁt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/de/Fr-alerte.ogg/Fr-alerte.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"alertes"},"formAudio":{"alertes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-alertes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Restez en alerte.","en":"Stay alert.","words":[{"g":"to stay","l":"rester"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"En cas d'urgence, alerte la police.","en":"In case of emergency, call the police.","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"case, situation"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"emergency, urgency"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"police"}]},{"text":"C'est sans doute une fausse alerte.","en":"It's probably a false alarm.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"false","l":"faux"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"no doubt"]]},{"text":"Nous avons eu deux fausses alertes, aujourd'hui.","en":"Today, we had two false alarms.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"false","l":"faux"},null,null,{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Ne t'inquiète pas. C'est sûrement une fausse alerte.","en":"Don't worry. It's probably a false alarm.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"worried","l":"inquiet"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"surely, certainly"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"false","l":"faux"},null]}]}